{"version":1,"youtubeId":"5uSvI9kftrA","start":2983,"end":3012,"segments":[{"start":2983,"end":3012,"mode":"F","confidence":0,"focus":{"x":0.5,"y":0.45}}],"sentences":[{"text":"But we see here.","s":2983.12,"e":2983.84,"next":2983.84,"key":"here","words":[{"w":"But","t":2983.12},{"w":"we","t":2983.28},{"w":"see","t":2983.44},{"w":"here.","t":2983.6}]},{"text":"He's saying, If Allah will be able to bring me back.","s":2983.84,"e":2987.2,"next":2987.2,"key":"saying","words":[{"w":"He's","t":2983.84},{"w":"saying,","t":2984.08},{"w":"If","t":2984.4},{"w":"Allah","t":2984.88},{"w":"will","t":2985.36},{"w":"be","t":2985.6},{"w":"able","t":2985.75},{"w":"to","t":2985.9},{"w":"bring","t":2986.05},{"w":"me","t":2986.2},{"w":"back.","t":2986.35}]},{"text":"I will surely be punished like no one was punished before.","s":2987.2,"e":2989.68,"next":2989.68,"key":"punished","words":[{"w":"I","t":2987.2},{"w":"will","t":2987.36},{"w":"surely","t":2987.52},{"w":"be","t":2987.84},{"w":"punished","t":2987.99},{"w":"like","t":2988.24},{"w":"no","t":2988.4},{"w":"one","t":2988.56},{"w":"was","t":2988.71},{"w":"punished","t":2988.86},{"w":"before.","t":2989.12}]},{"text":"This is in the past tense.","s":2989.68,"e":2990.8,"next":2990.8,"key":"tense","words":[{"w":"This","t":2989.68},{"w":"is","t":2989.84},{"w":"in","t":2990},{"w":"the","t":2990.16},{"w":"past","t":2990.31},{"w":"tense.","t":2990.48}]},{"text":"Now the rest of the Hadith runs in the past tense as well.","s":2990.8,"e":2993.04,"next":2993.04,"key":"Hadith","words":[{"w":"Now","t":2990.8},{"w":"the","t":2990.96},{"w":"rest","t":2991.12},{"w":"of","t":2991.27},{"w":"the","t":2991.42},{"w":"Hadith","t":2991.57},{"w":"runs","t":2991.76},{"w":"in","t":2992},{"w":"the","t":2992.15},{"w":"past","t":2992.3},{"w":"tense","t":2992.45},{"w":"as","t":2992.64},{"w":"well.","t":2992.8}]},{"text":"It reads, Quote, And so Allah gathered his dust together and said to him,","s":2993.04,"e":3000.88,"next":3000.88,"key":"gathered","words":[{